.* strip-events.gml - the hints strip-hints.xsl keeps (gml:dv, gml:pi,
.* gml:tcentry, gml:tcmark) and the ones it once let through (gml:sa,
.* gml:re, gml:fv, gml:ix, gml:pageno)
.dv sup font hi1 baseline p3 /1/
.rh on
Page &
.rh off
.h1 First chapter
Some text with a variable&sup. here.
.sa
.in 4
.fo off
Indented and unformatted.
.re
.fv top
Restored text.
.pi /Apples/
An apple.
.tc
.ix
The end.
